{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act31side_level_act31side_02_end",
  "groupId": "act31side",
  "stageId": "act31side_02",
  "title": "祭神農",
  "storyCode": "HS-2",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act31side/level_act31side_02_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "8ce7be14cef0200862786765095e34fe9efd14df1044c0a8451e33bbd4b7cee2",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "節日熱鬧的氛圍被一場突如其來的雨澆得涼透。\n雨飄飄灑灑停了下來，田間的積水卻不見消退，漸漸沒過了人的腳踝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "著急的農業天師",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎麼前面就下了這麼一陣雨，水都漫到這了？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "著急的農業天師",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "水這麼渾……該不會是連帶上游的髒土一塊沖過來了？再這樣下去田全要被污染了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "著急的農業天師",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "*炎國粗口*工地上的在幹嘛？快排水啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚慌的農業天師",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "出事了！堰口水壩塌了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "著急的農業天師",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他媽的！開什麼玩笑？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "資深土木天師",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "什麼情況！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年輕的土木天師",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不知道上游哪一塊源石礦脈炸了，碎屑跟著河流被沖了下來，過閘的時候捲到了堰口輪機裡，把壩炸出來一個洞！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "資深土木天師",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "之前為什麼沒發現？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年輕的土木天師",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "今年水位一直是正常的，之前也沒有監測到異常的源石反應，源石活性變化怎麼會這麼不規則……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "資深土木天師",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "見鬼的……偏偏還是汛期，水這麼急。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "資深土木天師",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "水裡面不知道還混著多少源石碎屑，被沖到田裡莊稼就全完了，可能還會造成人員感染。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "資深土木天師",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "都小心點！大壩本身的裂口一時半會修不好，先分人去下游堵！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年輕的土木天師",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這河水眼見越來越急，就怕壩體進一步崩塌，該怎麼辦——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "資深土木天師",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎麼辦？能怎麼辦！用源石技藝玩命堵著啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "污水還在蔓延著，田間早已是一片泥濘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦急的農地天師",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "動作快點！再搬點沙袋來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦急的農地天師",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這片可是試驗田，要是被水淹了損失就大了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦急的農地天師",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哎！你的源石技藝不是玩沙子嗎？加把勁啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慌亂的農業天師",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你才是玩沙子的……我的源石技藝明明是分析土壤的！唉，試試！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "職農、天師已經排成長龍，一袋袋沙土經過無數雙手傳遞到岸邊，在源石技藝的控制下，築起一道搖搖欲墜的堤壩。\n而堤壩還有最後一個缺口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慌亂的農業天師",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "有點……勉強……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "少年抱起一袋沙土躍身而起，想要飛身去堵上那個缺口。只覺得眼前一陣疾風吹來，牽絆住了他的腳步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你要做什麼？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "河水裡混進去的泥沙裡不知道有多少源石雜質，你是想被感染嗎！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "保護百姓是我的職責……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你憑什麼覺得所有人都需要你保護？你和站在這裡的人有什麼不一樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……我還能幫上什麼忙？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "剛才去調查過了，這是堰口水壩破壞導致的洪水……農田原有的排水系統已經超過負荷了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "正是汛期，堰口一時半會也修不好，靠堵是堵不上的，再這樣下去，損失只會越來越大……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……聽說你是信使，腳程快？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "還好……要我做什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這種時候大家都亂成一團，還是需要有人去現場整理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "拿著這張地圖，去上面標註的這幾號地塊，找到那裡負責的職農，讓所有人做好地塊移動的準備。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你打算……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "大荒城的移動城市改建雖然只完成了一部分，但還是有一些基本的移動功能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在水壩修好前，改變大荒城地塊排佈，利用地塊高低差，重新造一個排水系統出來……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "資深土木天師",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "咳——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "巨大的金屬鑄塊融解，填補在壩體的缺口上。\n而洪水彷彿是認得出壩體的薄弱處，不斷地衝擊著裂口，水流從金屬的縫隙間噴射出，像利刃一樣緩緩割開裂口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年輕的土木天師",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "老師！您的金屬源石技藝根本不是這麼用的，再這樣下去您是撐不住的，換我來撐一會吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "資深土木天師",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "退開！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "資深土木天師",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你的那點源石技藝水準，在我這還不夠看呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "資深土木天師",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "咳……咳……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "天有洪爐——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "資深土木天師",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "年……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "工廠那邊還沒忙完，怎麼外邊又是這麼大麻煩……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但是看這洪水陣仗……也真難為你們撐這麼久了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "資深土木天師",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "核心城以外的工程，不該讓你插手……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "臨時救個場也不算破壞規矩吧，你們幹工程的怎麼比司歲台還要迂腐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "行了，靠邊歇會吧。剩下的交給我就行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "土木天師",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你要操作大荒城地塊的排佈？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "來不及解釋了，我知道大荒城的移動地塊還沒有完全建好，但還是具備最基本的縱橫向移動功能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只要移動部分地塊，就能很大程度上排出農田淤積的污水。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "土木天師",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "開什麼玩笑！地塊的調度權只有榮女士和黍天師才有，別人不可能——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她們都在前面忙著指揮抗洪工作，根本沒有功夫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "現在洪水完全沒有減弱的趨勢，每一秒都有數不清的農田、莊稼在受災，難道你還要拉天師府開大會討論怎麼做嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "土木天師",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "土木天師",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我記得你，你是常常跟在黍天師身邊的那個天師學徒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "土木天師",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好……我就相信你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "土木天師",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可是大荒城大大小小有幾十塊農業地塊，重新排佈地塊多麼複雜，至少也要好幾個天師一整天的計算量，你一個人打算怎麼做？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不用查了。這片田的地圖都在我腦子裡，我現在就能給出一個方案。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "聽我指揮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "甲申號地塊，向東移動五格，乙未號地塊，下沉五級。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "土木天師",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "還愣著幹嘛！快操作啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "土木天師",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉！死馱獸當作活馱獸醫了！就信你一回！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慌張的職農",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎麼回事？地塊在動！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慌張的職農",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "水勢，好像小一點了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "大家當心！地塊正在移動，注意避險——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慌張的職農",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你光是告訴我們要避險，讓我們上哪去？躲到種植大棚裡去嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲青萍",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "諸位別慌張，請大家透過通道向丙卯地塊方向撤離，那裡現在地勢較高，可以盡可能遠離洪水。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "青萍！你怎麼在這裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲青萍",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我剛才見了禾生兄一面，他告知我他的打算。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雲青萍",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "河流是在大荒城的北面，如果想讓積水從大荒城西北側排到西南邊穀地的話。需要移動的地塊，大概也就是西側的這幾塊了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我竟然完全沒有想到……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小滿",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "綿綿！別跑！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "小滿小姐？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小滿",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "小燭台，小毛筆？是你們？大水牛呢？他沒事吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他……\n不用擔心，他在安全的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小滿",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "太好了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小滿",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不對，還不好，地塊動的時候牧獸們受驚從屋子裡跑出來了，快幫我攔一下他們！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受驚的牧獸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（恐懼的哼叫）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慌亂的職農",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哎哎！哪裡來的牧獸，別撞人啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小滿",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "綿綿！別亂跑！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "站住！前面是地塊邊緣！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "夕？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "誰允許你這樣使用能力——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遙遠的女聲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "拖拖拉拉的，慢得要死。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遙遠的女聲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等你一戶戶通知過去，水早就淹到家門口了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遙遠的女聲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "竟然還要幫司歲台的人解決麻煩……聽好了，就這一次，下不為例。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慌亂的職農",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們這是在哪……？這是哪位天師的源石技藝，這麼神通？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚訝的職農",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "快看！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚訝的職農",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "天好像，要放晴了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "大家都已經拼得精疲力盡了，大荒城也經不起這麼一遭了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "確實是意料之外的災害，用這種辦法破例幫大家一次，也是情有可原吧……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呼……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "散去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一陣清風吹過。\n大片的田地猶如呼吸般起伏。龐大的洪澇被切分成一條條可控制的濁流，悄無聲息地流入被規劃好的路線。\n倖存的牧獸站在地塊邊上，看著它腳下的洪水退去，用鼻子拱出一片乾淨的青草，埋頭啃食了起來。\n陽光透過雲層，照在劫後餘生的土地上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "大荒城甲申至丙寅地塊移動安全結束，積水已全部排入水渠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "報告完畢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萬侍郎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "損失如何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鄉長",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "甲申至乙寅地塊，都受到了污染。別的地塊影響不大，但也要細細排查。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鄉長",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這些田裡的莊稼全部收起來後就拿去處理掉，保守算，在原本就歉收的基礎上，夏收的糧還要再少些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萬侍郎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "都是百姓大半年的心血啊……今年的莊稼，足夠完成預定的份額嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萬侍郎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "會有多少百姓餓肚子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鄉長",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "還夠。畢竟是多少代人努力的結果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鄉長",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……只是，經不起再多變故了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧辭秋",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "遭遇了這樣的損失，已經不是大荒城內部的事。必須立即上書京城，整體協調炎國今年各地的糧食供給。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧辭秋",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……離大荒城最近的玉門年初也遭受了天災，修繕工作都還在進行中，抽調不出人手來支援。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萬侍郎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "確實。按工部記錄，這些年全國各地區的天災密度都超過了過往數十年的平均值。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萬侍郎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "真是多災之年……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鄉長",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "大荒城已經是糧產重鎮。再讓其他城市來支援我們，沒有這樣的道理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鄉長",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "移動地塊檢修不是眼下最緊急的事，大荒城要優先為農糧要務負責。多少塊眼看就要得出成果的試驗田還沒有搬遷到安全的地塊上……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鄉長",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "另外，十二樓五城的工程，進度需要放緩。之前抽調過去幫忙的天師，現在全部需要回來搶救剩下的耕地和糧食。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鄉長",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "之後的夏種，已經萬萬耽誤不得了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萬侍郎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萬侍郎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我體諒您這邊的辛苦，但是延期十二樓五城建設的事，我們是否應該再商議一下？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萬侍郎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "糧食固然重要，可十二樓五城同樣是國防重事，朝廷安排秋天前竣工的期限，不是無端決定。其中利弊得失，還需要仔細權衡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鄉長",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好啊……你想得周到，你最好現在寫份文書，派信使送去京城，拉尚書台好好開上十天的會，再回來給我們安排。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鄉長",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "糧食不是市面上的材料，少了千分之一的糧，不是糧價會漲千分之一。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鄉長",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是有千分之一的百姓會挨餓。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萬侍郎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那打起仗來，又會有多少百姓流離失所？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萬侍郎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "也別忘了，“十二樓五城”的起因到底是什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鄉長",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……河對岸的……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萬侍郎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您知道，不只如此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萬侍郎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "邪魔問題之外，更有——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧辭秋",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "二位。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萬侍郎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鄉長",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧辭秋",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這不是可以在此地討論的話題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧辭秋",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "慎言。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鄉長",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "*炎國粗口*。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧辭秋",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "利弊得失不是那麼容易量化計算的事，但眼前事情輕重緩急十分明確。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧辭秋",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "夏收夏種涉及大荒城數年的研究成果，乃至千萬人的溫飽，這件事也絕不能耽誤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧辭秋",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不如先請天師們幫忙這裡的職農檢查修復受災土地，這是切切實實一刻也不能耽誤的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧辭秋",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "至於十二樓五城的工期，我以禮部名義再去天師府請示，興許有天機閣的幫助，事情總還有周旋的餘地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧辭秋",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "若事後朝廷判斷此事處理不當，大不了，我來擔責。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萬侍郎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鄉長",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "算了吧，要問罪也該是問我，就說是我用刀架在這位侍郎大人脖子上逼他答應的。你還是上一邊去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萬侍郎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……唉。事都還沒做，現在就開始分責，事情是做不成的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萬侍郎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "事情要是出了疏漏，要承擔後果的是無數大炎百姓。我們不過是其中微不足道的三個人罷了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萬侍郎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "既然二位都堅持……我姑且，認可二位的判斷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萬侍郎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "希望二位不要忘記剛才做出的承諾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鄉長",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧辭秋",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒問題。相安無事，皆大歡喜。出了問題，您大可以推我出去頂罪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萬侍郎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃。不是，我沒那個意思，我只是想說情勢緊急，要跟天機閣通口氣——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鄉長",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "大人說得對。我這就去草擬一份詳細的受災報告，方便寧侍郎向天師府天機閣彙報。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧辭秋",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那我同樣要為此做準備，就先告辭了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萬侍郎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "二位——呃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萬侍郎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萬侍郎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……不過，現在至少禍害不到我工部頭上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萬侍郎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但願補給的物資，能及時到吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "嚕啦啦啦啦……嚕啦啦啦啦……\n小滿有一腳沒一腳地踢著田中的土塊。\n土塊歪歪扭扭地向前滾去，沒有一個明確的方向，小滿自己悶著頭走著，手裡甩著路旁摘的稗子草。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小滿",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "也不知道這次停電會停多久，天氣這麼熱，綿綿他們心裡又害怕，這樣下去很容易又鬧疫病……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小滿",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "飯也不吃覺也不睡，也不知道新搭的房子他們住不住得慣，急死我了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小滿",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "小禾也是，這幾天吃飯都沒看到他，他比馱獸還笨，不知道累了要休息的……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小滿",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉，總覺得天氣一年比一年差，莊稼也長得不好……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小滿",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "神農真的不管這片地了嗎……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她把草葉在手指上纏了又纏，纏成一個圈，又揉成一個團。\n小滿一揚手，想丟出去，卻又想起來之前黍姐姐十指一翻，就能編出一隻活靈活現小獸的樣子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小滿",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這些草帶給黍姐姐，她肯定能編出來好多東西，可是黍姐姐也好忙，連小燭台都不知道去哪了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小滿",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我多摘點回去，編好了送給他們解解悶吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小滿",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "綿綿又跑丟了，唉！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "小滿抬起腳，狠狠地踢出小土塊。\n土塊撞到了一根水稻稈，旋轉了兩下，慢悠悠地停了下來。\n嚕啦。\n水稻稈一片濃翠，看不出一絲傷痕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一場洪水。\n地裡的莊稼和所有人一樣，齊垂下了頭。\n一片狼藉中，只剩一株稻子兀自直立著。\n彷彿是汲取了周圍所有的生命力一般，它筆挺地高高舉起自己飽滿的穗，艷得像在嘲笑周圍倒伏下的一切。\n周遭事物黯然下去，唯有它如生命般永恆綻放。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "小滿忍不住，衝著這株稻子伸出自己想要觸摸的手。\n它鮮紅，鮮紅。\n一頭馱獸慢悠悠地走在水稻田的邊緣，太陽照在它的身上。\n它也鮮紅，鮮紅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "終於還是走到了這裡。\n疲憊的人闔上了她發紅的眼睛。\n河流淹沒了她的嘴，泥漿糊住了她的眼睛，草木了無生機地在風中搖晃，她努力分辨著那些聲音。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她的手輕輕拂過一株伏倒的禾苗，小苗像是得到了安撫一般，從泥漿中站直了身子。\n她閉上眼，河流流過她的頭髮，樹木的根系如同掌紋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好像很多年前，也有一段時期，天災像如今這麼頻繁……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……我沒能幫上什麼忙，就看到大片大片就要豐收的稻子全都倒在了地裡，整片地只剩下了那麼一小片，連半個口袋都沒能裝滿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你滿臉是泥，抱著袋子跟我說，怕什麼，一年一年的，總能種出結果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……那個時候，你的臉上好像還沒有皺紋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你也還不是什麼“神農”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎麼這麼多年過去了，離當初的那些宏願，還是那麼遠……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "腳下的大地上下起伏如同她的呼吸，像是在極深處藏著一顆火熱的心臟，沉重緩慢地跳動著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "這顆心臟上走來一串淺淺的腳步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "載具轟鳴聲從很遠的地方傳來，好幾個月才能聽到一回。\n遠行的商隊會帶來補給的物資，新奇的物件，還有各地的見聞。在大荒城日復一日的勞動生活裡，這些才是最讓人期待的事情。\n天邊的煙塵不一會工夫就到了眼前，打頭的載具上走下一個人來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "那人穿著一塵不染的輕薄華衫，風煙飄過萬里，追在他身後。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……你回來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "優雅的男性",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好久不見。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "優雅的男性",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "姐姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
